### array-element-looking word in a single-bracket -eq
[ counts[0] -eq 5 ] && echo five
>>> SC2170 1:3
>>> SC2255 1:3

### unquoted product in a single-bracket -eq
[ 12 -eq 3*4 ] && echo twelve
>>> SC2255 1:10

### same comparison in double brackets
[[ counts[0] -eq 5 ]] && echo five
[[ 12 -eq 3*4 ]] && echo twelve
>>> SC2154 1:4
>>> SC2309 1:4
